  "application_type_full": "Householder planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-e500ebcc-7fff-d332-1609-ec41e4d000d6&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.3800000000000001;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;No tree information has been provided to support the application to demonstrate how the proposed development would not result in the unacceptable loss of trees of amenity value. As such,&amp;nbsp;the proposal would result in the unacceptable loss of trees of amenity value&amp;nbsp;contrary to Policy LP51 of LP33&amp;nbsp; and the REA SPD 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposal, due to its size, design and siting&amp;nbsp;would have an detrimental impact upon the character and appearance of the host property and surrounding conservation area, contrary to Policies D1, D3, D4 &amp;amp; HC1 of The London Plan, Policy LP1 &amp;amp; LP3 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 and the Council’s REA SPD 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
